# whale-girl.grid v2 - the Codewhale whale girl. One character is one cell, '.' is empty.
# Same format as whale.grid; sprites/render.py parses both. See whale.grid for the line grammar.
#
# Layers: none drawn separately. Every sprite is a complete, flattened frame and every pose is one
# layer at 0,0. This file is the only source; edit the rows here.
#
# Two bodies, each drawn by hand; neither is a scaled copy of the other.
#   hero.*   39x52  one cell of outline included. Not below 2 pt per cell.
#   small.*  16x22  no outline. 1 to 4 pt per cell, and the terminal sprite.
# Poses for both: rest think read write run needs-you done sleep.
#
# B, K, C and A are shared with whale.grid (whale, line, cream, warn). Values live in theme.tokens.
# v2: needs-you is a ? in the warn ink; thinking is separate bubbles; small read, run, done redrawn;
#     hero sleep flukes fattened; girl-line renamed line, girl-cream renamed cream.
ink N girl-hair fill
ink B whale fill
ink T girl-pale open
ink S girl-skin open
ink s girl-blush open
ink C cream open
ink D girl-cloth fill
ink G girl-gold fill
ink K line fill
ink A warn fill

